# PR after push (mandatory)

## Trigger

Any successful `git push` where `gh pr view` succeeds for the current branch.

## Blocker

Do **not** send the final message to the user until the post-push checklist completes in the **same turn** as the push.

## What to run

Follow [`.cursor/skills/pr-after-push/SKILL.md`](../skills/pr-after-push/SKILL.md) (commands, mistakes, checklist). When review fixes are pushed, resolve addressed inline PR threads on GitHub in the same turn.

**Policy** (when `review this` is required): [`AGENTS.md`](../../AGENTS.md) section **After `git push` to a PR branch**.

A missed `review this` on a non-draft PR is a workflow failure.
